==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 63.33~73.33 seconds<sup>1,900f~2,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 1,200 seconds<sup>36,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

